factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 5 problems
  The draft says the Gram Sabha is on 1 November (நவ. 1), but the article only says the 1st of the month (வரும், 1ம் தேதி) for the upcoming meeting and mentions நவ., 1ம் தேதி later; the month is consistent with the article's later reference, so this is acceptable and not a problem. However, the caption states the Gram Sabha is 'வரும் 1ஆம் தேதி' while the reel says 'நவம்பர் 1ஆம் தேதி' — these match the article, so no issue there.
  The reel_script says the meeting is 'உள்ளாட்சிகள் தினத்தையொட்டி' and that residents of Periyanaickenpalayam union 'பங்கேற்பார்கள்' — the article says residents of the union's villages are preparing questions, which is roughly consistent.
  The caption and reel omit the article's key factual detail that Kanuvai and Onnipalayam panchayats were newly formed, but this is in the caption, not reel; the reel_script omits the list of the 11 panchayats and the government schemes (wording only).
  The reel_script states that the 'அனைத்துத் துறை அதிகாரிகள்' absence is a problem, but the article says that all-department officials do not participate in Gram Sabha meetings — the draft says officials 'பங்கேற்க வேண்டும்' (should participate), which is a demand, not a fact error.
  The slides_spec claims 'பல கூட்டங்களில் புகார் கூறியும் நடவடிக்கை இல்லை' — the article says complaints at each meeting have no action taken, which matches.
